# Deno / npm
node_modules/
dist/
.aio/

# Packaged builds. `deno task compile:electron` drops its AppImage beside the
# app rather than in dist/, and a 143 MB artifact in a git repo is a mistake
# GitHub refuses on your behalf.
*.AppImage
*.app.zip

# Rust build tree (the committed artifact is src/llama-sys.wasm)
rust/target/

# The aio framework is vendored by symlink to a sibling checkout, so it is not
# part of this repository. See README.md — "Building from source".
dep/aio

# The quality specs are shared from ~/.katana as symlinks; the app-specific ones
# are committed, these two are not resolvable outside the author's machine.
.katana/_aio.md
.katana/_universal.md

# Local noise
*.log
*.swp
*.deb
